BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (Assistant output:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (  **The Tale of the Two Wells**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (  In ancient times, two villages stood separated by a barren valley. Each village had a sacred w) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    ell, but the Northern well flowed weakly while the Southern well ran dry.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (  The Goddess of Abundance appeared to the North, saying: "Pour your water into the valley, and ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (    watch what blooms.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (  The Northern elder was afraid. "If we give our water away, we'll have nothing.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (  But a young woman stepped forward. "Trust," she said, pouring one bucket into the valley. Mira) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (    culously, it became three buckets by the time it reached the South.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (  The Southern village rejoiced. Their elder declared, "This gift must be honored!" They returne) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (    d two buckets to the North.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (  Now both villages had more than before. The cycle continued-each act of giving multiplied, eac) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (    h return honored the trust. The valley between them transformed into flowering gardens that ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (    fed both peoples.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (  But the goddess warned: "This magic lives only when both give freely and return generously. Ho) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (    ard, and the wells run dry. Break trust, and the desert returns.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (  The villages prospered for generations, understanding that abundance flows not from grasping, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (    but from the sacred dance of giving and receiving.) Tj ET
