BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (  In ancient times, there lived two villages separated by a barren valley. The Sky Keeper blesse) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (    d the first village with a sacred spring that produced five vessels of water each day.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (  The Spring Guardian faced a choice: keep the water, or send it across the valley. If shared, t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    he Water Spirits would triple any amount given, transforming scarcity into abundance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (  One day, the Guardian sent all five vessels across the valley. The spirits blessed the gift, a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    nd fifteen vessels reached the other village. The people there rejoiced, but then faced thei) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (    r own test: how much to return?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (  A wise elder spoke: "The Guardian trusted us with everything. The spirits multiplied their fai) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (    th into abundance. If we return generously, both villages shall prosper. But if we hoard, th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (    e spirits will witness our betrayal, and the spring may run dry forever.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (  The villagers returned ten vessels. Both communities thrived with enough water for all.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (  From that season forward, both villages understood the sacred law: *Trust given and multiplied) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (     must be honored with fair return. In the cycle of giving and reciprocity, none shall thirst) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    , but all shall flourish.*) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (  The spring never failed those who remembered this wisdom.) Tj ET
