BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      rned ten blooms. Not once did doubt cloud their hands, not once did calculation slow their) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (       movements.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    Ninth twilight arrived-the Twilight of Triple Threes. The Southern Gardener stood before fif) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      teen perfect blooms. A wandering philosopher observed: "Nine seasons prove the pattern wor) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      ks. But do you follow it from wisdom or from blindness?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (    The Southern Gardener laughed gently: "You mistake the question entirely. To ask whether I f) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      ollow from wisdom or blindness assumes I still follow something outside myself. Nine seaso) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      ns didn't teach us to trust a pattern-they revealed we ARE the pattern. My hands return te) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      n blooms not because I've calculated it's wise, but because these hands know no other lang) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      uage.") Tj ET
